---
import ProjectLayout from '../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/project/ProjectNav.astro';
import NextProject from '../components/project/NextProject.astro';
import '../styles/projects/planet-zeta.css';
---

<ProjectLayout title="Planet Zeta · Sasha">
<div class="page" style="font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2E2326; background: #F6F1EA; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 110px">
<div style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #D3E3F1 0%, #E5ECF0 55%, #F6F1EA 100%); padding-bottom: 48px">
<ProjectNav />
<header class="wrap" style="text-align: center; padding-top: 88px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 26px; color: #355A7E">Educational game</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 128px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.92">Planet Zeta.</h1>
<p style="margin: 28px auto 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436; text-wrap: balance">A game that introduces children to environmental conservation. Players complete missions, answer quizzes and explore regions while learning how everyday actions protect the planet.</p>
</header>
<div class="col" style="margin-top: 48px">
<div class="meta">
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4F6B85">Year</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">2025</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4F6B85">Team</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">Team project</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4F6B85">Role</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">UI/UX, characters, marketing</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #4F6B85">Play</p><a href="https://navisasabina.github.io/Planet-Zeta/" style="font-weight: 600">Play the game ↗</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
<div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #B9D2EA 0%, #D3E3F1 55%, #E5ECF0 100%)">
<div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">navisasabina.github.io/Planet-Zeta</span></div>
<img src="assets/planetzeta-title.jpg" alt="Planet Zeta title screen" style="width: 100%; display: block">
</div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 80px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">The idea</h2>
<p style="margin: 0">Kids want to play games. So we made one they'd actually want to play, and slipped the learning in along the way. You explore the planet, take on missions and answer quizzes about looking after nature. No textbook needed.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 56px">
<div class="duo">
<div class="panel" style="background: #E5ECF0"><div class="browser round tilt" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">planet-zeta / map</span></div><img src="assets/planetzeta-map.jpg" alt="Planet Zeta world map" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; display: block"></div></div>
<div class="panel" style="background: #D3E3F1"><div class="browser round tilt2" style="width: 100%"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">planet-zeta / quiz</span></div><img src="assets/planetzeta-quiz.jpg" alt="Planet Zeta quiz reward screen" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; display: block"></div></div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Game features</h2>
<div class="feat">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Environmental missions</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Educational quizzes</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Explorable regions</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Story-driven gameplay</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Child-friendly interface</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Reward-based progression</div>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 64px 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Tools used</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px">
<span style="background: #D3E3F1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D4E6E">Figma</span>
<span style="background: #D3E3F1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D4E6E">Canva</span>
<span style="background: #D3E3F1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D4E6E">HTML</span>
<span style="background: #D3E3F1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D4E6E">CSS</span>
<span style="background: #D3E3F1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #2D4E6E">JavaScript</span>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: 64px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1E9F0; border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #355A7E">My part</p>
<p style="margin: 0">I designed the UI and the characters, helped shape the game idea from the start, and handled the marketing once it was ready to play.</p>
</div>

<div class="stage" style="margin-top: 32px; border-radius: 28px; padding: clamp(14px,3vw,32px) clamp(14px,3vw,32px) 0; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #E5ECF0 0%, #D3E3F1 100%)"><div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">planet-zeta / settings</span></div><img src="assets/planetzeta-settings.jpg" alt="Planet Zeta settings screen" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 21 / 9; object-fit: cover; display: block"></div></div>

<p style="margin: 40px 0 0">It's playable in the browser, so go give it a try: <a href="https://navisasabina.github.io/Planet-Zeta/" style="font-weight: 600">play Planet Zeta ↗</a></p>
</article>

<div class="col" style="padding-top: 96px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B5F60; font-weight: 600">Next project</p>
<NextProject href="abita.html" name="ABiTA" bg="#F2E4B8" />
</div>
</div>
</ProjectLayout>
